.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xencode 1  "xencode 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
xencode \- Xencode — AI development assistant (Rust core)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxencode\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Xencode — AI development assistant (Rust core)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
xencode\-scan(1)
Scan a workspace and list all entries
.TP
xencode\-config(1)
Configuration management
.TP
xencode\-models(1)
Local model management (Ollama & llama.cpp)
.TP
xencode\-cache(1)
Response cache management
.TP
xencode\-audit(1)
The session server\*(Aqs audit log
.TP
xencode\-advisories(1)
Known security advisories for the crates this project depends on
.TP
xencode\-query(1)
Send a query to a model
.TP
xencode\-memory(1)
Manage conversation memory
.TP
xencode\-tasks(1)
Manage background tasks (file\-backed, survives this process)
.TP
xencode\-worktree(1)
Manage git worktrees of the current repository
.TP
xencode\-colab(1)
Google Colab bridge: preflight, then up / status / down for a model server running on a Colab VM
.TP
xencode\-advise(1)
Repository insights from the .xencode snapshot: broken imports, import cycles, hub files and orphans
.TP
xencode\-server(1)
Start the collaboration server
.TP
xencode\-analyze(1)
Analyze code for issues and vulnerabilities
.TP
xencode\-fetch(1)
Fetch a web page and extract research\-ready text
.TP
xencode\-interop(1)
Measure what the coding\-agent CLIs on this machine actually do
.TP
xencode\-anchor(1)
Find this repository\*(Aqs build and test commands, run them, and record only the ones that actually worked
.TP
xencode\-toolchain(1)
Run the project\*(Aqs own toolchain checks, and report structured evidence
.TP
xencode\-generate(1)
Print shell completions or the man page; both are generated from the clap definition, never written by hand
.TP
xencode\-mutants(1)
Find code whose tests cannot tell right from wrong
.TP
xencode\-cov(1)
Report which lines this diff added were never executed
.TP
xencode\-test(1)
Run the tests, and never call a test that only passed on retry a pass
.TP
xencode\-review(1)
Review the diff between a base branch and HEAD, file by file
.TP
xencode\-replay(1)
Run a recorded session again from the bytes it was made of
.TP
xencode\-eval(1)
Score the agent on defects that were seeded on purpose
.TP
xencode\-plugin(1)
Manage plugins
.TP
xencode\-llamacpp(1)
llama.cpp server management (status/start/stop/load/unload)
.TP
xencode\-hw(1)
What this machine can serve, read from the machine
.TP
xencode\-history(1)
How fast this repository\*(Aqs history is to ask about, and how to speed it up
.TP
xencode\-tui(1)
Launch the Terminal User Interface
.TP
xencode\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
